# Flash size confirmed real (bootloader reads 16MB directly off the chip's
# JEDEC ID at boot). PSRAM is currently DISABLED - the board hard-faults
# at boot with "PSRAM ID read error: 0x00000000, PSRAM chip not found"
# when CONFIG_SPIRAM_BOOT_INIT is on and PSRAM doesn't answer, which
# bricks every boot regardless of what the app code needs. Confirm the
# real module SKU (text printed on the WROOM-1 module's metal shield)
# before re-enabling CONFIG_SPIRAM=y / CONFIG_SPIRAM_MODE_OCT=y.
# Only consulted when sdkconfig.esp32-s3-devkitc-1 doesn't exist yet -
# delete that file to force a fresh regen against these defaults.
CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHSIZE_16MB=y
CONFIG_PARTITION_TABLE_SINGLE_APP_LARGE=y
